  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-47066" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Organization for Migration (IOM)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Development and Implementation of Immigration and Border Management Activities in Asia and the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to:1. Providing technical assistance to country offices including field missions to develop/enhance IBM programmes in the region. 2. Identifying necessary technical expertise to support the activities of IBM Unit, including the development and/or upgrading or border management software that could also be used by country office-led projects. 3. Identifying necessary capacity building activities for IOM staff of IBM Unit, including trainings on IBM related works. Worth noting that this new knowledge and skill could then be cascaded to relevant IOM staff in the Country Offices. 4. Representing IOM in regional and international conferences, workshops and meetings as requested/approved by the Regional Director.</narrative>
  </description>
